  "{@0} {@1} podstavy a hlavný vrchol: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$.": "{@0} {@1} de la base y el vértice principal: ${@2} + 1 = {@3}$.",
  "{@0} {@1} podstavy a {@2} {@3}: $2\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$.": "{@0} {@1} de la base y {@2} {@3}: $2\\cdot {@4} = {@5}$.",
